1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:03,995
[Leo] I just inherited TA-05, background checks.

2
00:00:04,015 --> 00:00:05,181
[Leo] Where do I start?

3
00:00:05,201 --> 00:00:07,950
[Ava] Five steps, and the first one comes with coffee.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,396
[Ava] Here they are.

5
00:00:09,416 --> 00:00:13,936
[Ava] Step one is a 90-minute workshop with the people who actually do the work.

6
00:00:13,956 --> 00:00:17,614
[Leo] So not just the person who wrote the procedure in 2015?

7
00:00:17,634 --> 00:00:18,261
[Ava] Right.

8
00:00:18,281 --> 00:00:22,079
[Ava] Pro tip: walk one real, recent case from start to finish.

9
00:00:22,729 --> 00:00:26,687
[Ava] Step two: map a swimlane, one lane per role, starting with the trigger.

10
00:00:26,707 --> 00:00:30,484
[Leo] Tasks are boxes, and every "it depends" becomes a decision?

11
00:00:30,504 --> 00:00:31,327
[Ava] Exactly.

12
00:00:31,347 --> 00:00:34,609
[Ava] Follow every branch to the end, even the awkward ones.

13
00:00:36,059 --> 00:00:40,340
[Ava] Watch out for the classic trap: mapping the ideal, not what really happens.

14
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,106
[Leo] Guilty.

15
00:00:41,126 --> 00:00:45,054
[Leo] My last map had zero exceptions and a very happy unicorn.

16
00:00:45,074 --> 00:00:47,682
[Ava] If it really takes three weeks, write three weeks.

17
00:00:48,332 --> 00:00:49,735
[Ava] Step three: controls.

18
00:00:49,755 --> 00:00:52,273
[Ava] What gets checked, by whom, with what evidence.

19
00:00:52,293 --> 00:00:56,123
[Leo] Like no background check before the candidate signs consent?

20
00:00:56,143 --> 00:00:59,134
[Ava] Yes, and the e-signature timestamp is the evidence.

21
00:00:59,154 --> 00:01:02,270
[Ava] Key or SOX controls need a control review.

22
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:06,647
[Ava] Step four: country notes, only where local law changes a step.

23
00:01:06,667 --> 00:01:08,702
[Leo] Okay, give me a real example.

24
00:01:08,722 --> 00:01:12,324
[Ava] California bans criminal checks before a conditional offer.

25
00:01:12,344 --> 00:01:16,233
[Ava] In China, private employers can't get official criminal records.

26
00:01:16,883 --> 00:01:18,271
[Ava] Step five: submit.

27
00:01:18,291 --> 00:01:21,689
[Ava] The process chain ends with the Head of HR Operations.

28
00:01:21,709 --> 00:01:24,403
[Leo] So I refresh my inbox every four minutes?

29
00:01:24,423 --> 00:01:25,210
[Ava] No need.

30
00:01:25,230 --> 00:01:27,833
[Ava] The Approvals page shows which step it's on.

31
00:01:30,883 --> 00:01:33,429
[Ava] Workshop, map, controls, country notes, submit.

32
00:01:33,449 --> 00:01:35,645
[Ava] Reality first, improvements second.

33
00:01:35,665 --> 00:01:36,996
[Leo] And no unicorns.

34
00:01:37,016 --> 00:01:39,940
[Leo] Next time: who actually clicks approve?
